Chapter: RunProcessFullTest
  cites Codex chapter Console
  cites Codex chapter Process
  cites Codex chapter Text

 Probes the run-process-full builtin end-to-end: subprocesses `git`
 with a known-succeeding arg, inspects stdout, stderr, and exit-code
 fields of the returned ProcessResult record, and prints a one-line
 summary that pins each channel's observable behaviour.

Section: Functions

  opening : [Console, Process] Nothing = act
    r <- run-process-full "dotnet" "--version"
    print-line ("stdout-bytes=" ++ integer-to-text (text-length (r.stdout))
             ++ " stderr-bytes=" ++ integer-to-text (text-length (r.stderr))
             ++ " exit=" ++ integer-to-text (r.exit-code))
  end
